      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GUNAI RAMBO (3) is yet to miss the placings in an excellent record this trip which boasts two wins. Scored by last time (19.57) in a Mix 6/7 over 350m at this track. Looks suited and should go close. WILD ORANGE (4) hit the ground running with a slick early sectional but ran over late and missed the frame when a 3.5 lengths fourth (19.58) over 350m at this track. The form out of last run is most impressive. Cannot be taken lightly. DIRTY APOLLO (7) is building a strong record, the latest hitting the ground running and leading throughout to score (22.30) at Shepparton in Maiden over 390m. Superior out of the boxes and will be in the firing line early. Sure to measure up. MANILA PANDA (8) has been in the placings at his last two runs, most recently when second (29.97) in a Restricted WIN over 515m at Sandown.",
